// Extra config for real-size nf-core runs launched by Geth (after the site's profile; GETH_NFCORE_CONFIG,
// applied last, can change these limits). nf-core resource labels apply as written, capped to a size
// that typical cluster nodes can schedule.
process {
    resourceLimits = [cpus: 16, memory: 128.GB, time: 48.h]
}
